WEBVTT

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.470
The King of Glanzreich,
Viktor von Glanzreich.

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:11.710
He took the throne at eighteen, becoming
the youngest king in Glanzreich's history.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.510
His extraordinary strategic
talents quickly transformed

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.740
the army into the strongest
force on the western continent.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.120
This achievement earned him the nickname

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.210
of the God of War.

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:59.590
Assailed by the
Greatest of Trials

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:13.600
His Majesty the King has just
returned after half a year away.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:19.440
His Majesty wishes to meet
with you and the princes.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:22.830
Would you come to His Majesty's
office in the morning?

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.710
Understood.

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:31.450
I feel more nervous than usual.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:35.370
Please wait here.

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:38.590
The princes are already waiting.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.130
It is an honor to meet with the king.

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:45.090
Your Highnesses must be happy to see your
father for the first time in six months, no?

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.300
How tense...

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.020
I do not dislike Father, of course.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.520
I respect him, but—

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:57.270
Let's just say there's a lot
we fuss about as his sons.

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:03.000
For your information, only Kai here with his
big heart is purely happy to see Father.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.700
I love Father... We should all get along...

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.540
All creatures on Earth are neighbors...

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.410
We are all one family...

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:13.530
Big? I would say his heart
is galactic in scale.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.290
Do we have to see Father?

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.040
Perhaps I should not be
surprised by their reactions.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.360
Their relationship is that of a
king and his potential successors.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:27.210
It must be different from an
ordinary father-son relationship.

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.410
Are you ready?

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.060
Yes.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:38.030
Your Majesty, the princes and the
royal tutor are here to see you.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.070
Send them in.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.990
The King of Glanzreich...

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.930
Viktor von Glanzreich.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.380
Aren't you going to greet His Majesty?

00:03:58.060 --> 00:03:58.700
Erm...

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:02.550
Your Majesty, we are glad
for your safe return.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:05.990
Thank you for your service to the
country during your travels.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.420
I am the royal tutor, Heine, at your service.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:12.430
I am truly grateful for
the honor of meeting you.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:16.560
Your Majesty?

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:19.890
Wha...

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.990
F-Forgive me. I cannot contain my emotions.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:29.080
My sons are already greeting
their father formally...

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.200
They've grown up so fast...

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.700
H-Huh?!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:35.500
Cut it out! We're not kids anymore!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.250
You taught us how to properly greet a royal.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:40.210
Don't cry...

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:43.240
The truth is, this happens
every time we see him.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.710
I was embarrassed about you seeing it.

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:47.960
Ah, so this is why you
were less than thrilled.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:52.970
So even the God of War is an ordinary
father with his children, hmm?

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.900
I missed you, my boys.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:52.970
Cut it out!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:56.100
Thank you for grooming my sons.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:00.470
Are you already acquainted?

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:03.020
No, only through writing.

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:07.250
I heard of an excellent tutor,
and we exchanged a number of letters.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.480
I offered him a post in
the palace based on them.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:13.690
So, are you getting along well
with your new royal tutor?

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.280
You don't have to tell us to.

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.210
I-I don't really care...

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:21.290
If you aren't outright objecting,
it must be all right.

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:23.250
Now, to business.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:30.590
From now on I will be speaking to
you not as your father, but as king.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:35.180
According to the royal tutor's report,

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:38.730
Bruno and Kai did well
on the competency test.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.900
Bruno, your studies are perfect,

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:45.070
but you will need to think more flexibly
if you are to become a leader.

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:46.190
Y-Yes, sir.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.950
Kai, I have no complaints about your ability,

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:53.490
but you should work on your communication
skills and learn how to convey your emotions.

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:57.830
Licht. You scored 60 because you thought
it a chore and got sloppy, no?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:58.450
Crap.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.780
You will have to break that habit of yours.

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:01.920
Fine.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:03.920
Yes, sir.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:07.000
But Leonhard is the most problematic.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.240
I was so shocked that I doubted my own eyes.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:10.710
Huh?

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.340
Did I do something?

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:13.560
One point on your test.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.300
One point!

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:15.070
One point...

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:17.340
You scored one point on
your test, Your Highness.

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:18.190
Ah.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.850
He finally remembered.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.730
I was also surprised by the grading method.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:27.030
One point for writing his name, when he
answered every single question incorrectly?

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.860
You must have done so out
of kindness. Thank you.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:30.690
Not at all.

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:34.860
However, either way, if this continues
you will never be ready for the throne.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:39.640
Three days from now,
you will retake this test.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:43.420
Unless you match Licht's score of 60...

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.920
Leonhard, I will strip you
of your right to the throne.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:55.260
I asked Heine to give each
of you equal treatment,

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.020
but I will allow an exception
for these three days.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:01.180
Can I count on you to give Leonhard
extra evening lessons, Heine?

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:01.930
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:05.310
But, Father, isn't that
too much for Leonhard?

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:09.820
That is all I have to say. Forgive me,
but I must attend to my duties now.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:13.810
We'll catch up later, my dear sons.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:24.210
I'm too stupid to be king...
It's all because I'm dumb... What do I do?

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.870
<i>He's churning out reflective
diaries at a tremendous pace.</i>

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.870
What do I do? What do I do?

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:30.650
But I am impressed with His Majesty.

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:34.580
When he speaks as king he is unsparingly stern,
even with the sons he loves dearly.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:36.070
Leonhard...

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:39.140
Our dumb dad didn't have to do
that to him in front of us.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:44.330
He must have judged that we should also know,
as competitors for the throne.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.910
Do not speak ill of Father.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:50.360
Don't get so down.
You could actually be lucky!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.040
See, being king must come
with tons of trouble.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.220
Think of it as dodging that bullet.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:55.900
No...

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.660
I'm not upset about my right to the throne.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.870
It just hurts that Father
is unhappy with me.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:07.930
It's miserable. I never knew bad
grades could be this frustrating.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:09.420
Leonhard...

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:13.180
But Your Highness has a history
of driving out royal tutors.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:17.930
Only Yourself To Blame

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.930
You have only yourself to blame, no?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.640
H-How dare you...

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.920
I'm willing to listen to a counterargument.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.890
Ugh. Say whatever you want.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:23.940
I'm no good for the throne, anyway.
My life as a prince is over.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:27.190
Oh, no. You can rise back up.

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:31.770
It is only truly over when you
are no longer frustrated.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:36.250
You still have three days.
I will do my utmost to help you.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:37.580
But...

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.530
Bruno?

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:44.060
We brothers are rivals vying for the throne.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:48.030
But I cannot watch my
dear brother lose heart.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.210
I will also do whatever I can for you.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.370
Me, too...

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:56.640
Sheesh. I'd look heartless if I was
the only one to abandon you now.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:00.130
Kai... Bruno... Licht...

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:05.390
Bring it on. I swear I'll show Father!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.730
Are those tears in your eyes? Did you cry?

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:11.010
Wha... N-No! This is just a runny nose!

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:11.900
Gross!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:18.440
Come to think of it, we cannot help if
we don't know Leonhard's academic level.

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.410
I'm sure he can at least add one and one.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:22.360
Huh?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.780
What?!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.960
Leonhard, what is one plus one?

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:33.330
Three?

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:38.510
Hang on! How can he retake that
test in three days from nothing?

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:43.170
He has to score at least 60 or our cold-hearted
dad will kick him out of the line of succession!

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:45.390
I told you to stop speaking ill of Father.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:51.830
The test consists of basic questions in
language, arithmetic, history, and geography.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:56.270
Arithmetic has the highest number of points.
It would be difficult to pass without it.

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:59.390
I said I would help him study,
and I want to do all I can...

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:03.230
Leonhard, are you <i>sure</i> that
one plus one equals three?

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.150
Think really hard!

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:07.150
I've got it!

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.580
One plus one is eleven!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.330
That isn't how arithmetic works.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:14.420
Prince Leonhard, the answer
is not eleven, either.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.110
What?

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:18.330
If you do not know the answer,
count on your fingers.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:21.010
Oh, right. I did learn that.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.340
Erm... One plus one...

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:25.640
I know! One plus one is two!

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.390
Correct.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.990
I can see those 60 points now.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:30.890
I can't.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.850
Let us try a slightly harder one.
What is four plus three?

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.310
Okay... Four plus three...

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.060
I don't have enough fingers...

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:42.500
Observe. He does not even
consider using his left hand.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.370
This should give you a glimpse
of my daily struggles.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.440
My respect for you grows
greater still, Master.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.550
Forget about the test. Doesn't this
bode badly for him as a person?

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.870
How should we teach him?

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:56.310
It's easier when you mix things you
don't like with things you do.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.460
Leonhard is athletic...

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.010
He could run until he solves the problem.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:02.500
That would be a punishment.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:03.920
No good...?

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:05.240
Do cheer up.

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:08.010
The part about things you like could work.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.230
I bet I could learn formulas in one glance

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.730
if they were written across
the bosom of a buxom lady.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.540
Why not have Bruni teach you?
You like him better than the professor.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.370
You might start to like studying.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:19.730
D-Do you hear yourself?

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:22.820
What? Writing formulas across Bruno's bosom?

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.690
Do <i>you</i> hear yourself?

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:30.220
Goodness gracious. I could never teach
you better than Master. How outrageous.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.950
You should certainly try it,
if there is a chance it might work.

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:37.280
Please leave it to me, Master.
I won't let you down!

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:38.800
Straight to it, then.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:43.790
Listen, Leonhard. When adding,
the sum might be two digits...

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:48.810
He's saying such complicated things.
Bruno never fails to impress!

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:51.630
Amazing, Bruno! What a genius!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.430
Are you listening, Leonhard?

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.300
Huh?

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.310
In other words,

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.580
if you memorize the sums of single-digit
numbers, you can add up to any digit...

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:58.580
He's perfect. I respect him so much.

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:03.280
No! I can't concentrate on
my studies because of Bruno!

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:06.900
He's too amazing.
Arithmetic is the last thing on my mind.

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.780
A brother complex for Prince Bruno only.

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:11.560
I don't understand what
went wrong. I'm sorry.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:15.790
His respect backfired? We'll have
to resort to drastic measures.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.800
The test will be the same as before.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.510
Therefore, he only has to memorize
all the answers and he's good!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:22.100
That is not good!

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:23.540
What did you hit me for?

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:26.460
Cheating is unacceptable. We cannot do that.

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:27.290
Agreed.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:28.140
But come on...

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:32.540
Do you really think he can remember
more than 50 answers in order?

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.820
Please do not underestimate his brain.

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:35.690
That's your objection?

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.820
Master, is there any studying method
that would work for Leonhard?

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.360
It seems hopeless...

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.340
I have made arrangements,
though I cannot say if they will work.

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:44.360
Excuse me.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.830
I have what you asked for.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:51.910
Sachertorte!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.460
There are six slices of torte.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.130
If each of us took one,
how many would be left?

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.620
There would only be one
slice left, of course.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:05.800
You did it, Leonhard. You subtracted
five from six in an instant.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:10.030
If there's only one slice left and
we give it to Father, it's all gone.

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:13.530
Leonhard? Are you listening? Hello?

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:12.440
I wanted at least one more slice...

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.010
Huh? Did I just do math?

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:20.400
I believe that your anxiety toward
studying sends you into a panic.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.720
If you slowly grow accustomed
to studying, you will be fine.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:27.230
You're onto something. Using torte as
an example makes it feel more relatable.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.580
Say there are 30 slices of torte.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:32.240
If five people take one each,
how many slices are left?

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:35.030
U-Um, 25?

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:37.730
Say there are 250 slices of torte.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:39.520
How much torte are we going to have?

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.270
Shh. It's working.
Keep your comments to yourself.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:03.770
Wow, 15 points? I've never earned
such a high mark before.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:06.540
You are still short of 60 points.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:11.200
Oh, right. I have to get 60.
So I still need...

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.660
27 points?!

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:14.910
That would be 45, Your Highness.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:17.480
Leonhard...

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:20.040
Don't panic. There's still... No time!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.510
The test is tomorrow morning!

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:26.040
How will he get from 15 points to 60?
He'll lose his claim to the throne!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.080
Licht!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:30.050
Leonhard. It'll be okay.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:34.120
It is quite late. Please return
to your rooms, Your Highnesses.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:34.930
But...

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:37.090
Leave this to me.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:47.150
Now, let us study.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:50.150
The test is tomorrow. It's pointless.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:55.140
Father's going to abandon me.
I hate studying.

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:57.100
I give up. I can't do this.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:15:02.670
Father's going to hate me.
My life is over. It's all over...

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:08.220
It is time for a lesson.

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:12.800
You learned something from this test, no?

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:15.790
What could I learn from a mere 15 points?

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:20.540
You learned that studying is
difficult for you, did you not?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:26.310
You can learn once you understand
how little you know.

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:29.820
You cannot grow from a
test with perfect marks.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:34.700
But with this score of 15,
you can grow another 85 points.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:41.210
If you think of it that way,
a bad mark is very exciting, no?

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:46.030
Oh? Are you going to study?

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:50.800
I'm suffering so much, and you think
I should be excited? I hate teachers.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:56.590
I'll show you. I'll study all night
and score at least 60 tomorrow.

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:58.440
Hurry up and teach me!

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:02.010
Very well. But be sure to sleep,
for health's sake.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.550
I would like to sleep, myself.

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:11.320
Glanzreich Fortress was built in 1620.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.820
When its lord's grandson, Otto II,
was named Count Glanzreich,

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.580
the current royal line began...

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:20.570
That is enough for your last-minute
cramming. It is almost time.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:22.430
I will go with you.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.990
Good morning, Leonhard. Royal Tutor.

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.590
G-Good morning, Father.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.600
Come have a seat.

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:49.310
We will begin the test now.
You have one hour.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:53.230
If Leonhard scores 60 or higher,
he will keep his claim to the throne.

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:55.040
Begin.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.690
Once a test begins,
no one can come to his aid.

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:02.570
A teacher can only believe in his student.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.080
Time is up.

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:17.120
Royal Tutor, if you would grade the test.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:17.880
Your Majesty.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.650
Your score is...

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.590
59 points.

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.980
Awesome! I got 59 points!

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.610
Seriously, Leo?!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:40.080
Incredible! You answered
more than half correctly!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.230
Great job.

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:44.170
Ahem. That is less than 60 points.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:50.000
This is exactly why Father's
going to abandon me.

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:51.190
Your Majesty...

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:56.210
If he cannot show results, then I cannot
allow Leonhard to be in the line of succession.

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:57.510
But...!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:05.180
However, this test may be graded
incorrectly, Royal Tutor.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:05.840
Pardon?

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:12.360
With your grading method, don't you
add one point for writing one's name?

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:17.860
60 points. Congratulations, Leonhard.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.500
Leonhard...

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:20.860
Th-Thank God...

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:23.150
Oh? Aren't you happy?

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:28.220
B-But I really only scored 59...
Are you sure, Father?

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:31.210
I only followed Heine's grading method.

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:34.370
You are Heine's student now, after all.

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:37.980
Do you not want to be his student?

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:46.220
I-I hate teachers. But I don't hate Heine.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:50.990
I don't think I could have
gotten a 59 without him.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:58.600
Then continue to pay attention
to his lessons, and study hard.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:01.720
So that you will be fit for the throne.

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.490
Yes, sir!

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.940
Can you promise the professor that, too?

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:11.430
Thank you. Um... I'll keep trying, so...

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:17.410
keep... keep teaching me,
Heine. Professor Heine.

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:26.840
Of course. I look forward to
our lessons, Prince Leonhard.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.620
What is this?

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.780
I am returning your personal handshake.

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:37.200
Besides, if I gave you a firm handshake now,
I think you would cry again.

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:39.040
Wha...! I-I wouldn't...!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.730
Besides, the time for
this has already passed.

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:41.350
Huh?

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:46.080
I ponder my students' futures
night and day as a teacher.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.040
You're only asking me to now,

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.290
but I've actually already done
a considerable amount of work.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:54.800
Wh-What's with the cold reaction?
How do you think I felt saying that?

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:57.330
Calm down, Leo. He's just being shy.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.300
Snort

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.300
How is that shy?!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.180
Wonderful, Leonhard.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:04.890
You've protected your claim to the throne
and come to appreciate Master's brilliance.

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.640
Yes, all those who are lost
on the path to knowledge

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:09.310
will be enveloped by the
ocean known as Master...

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.310
I don't follow.

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:15.160
I don't think you're brilliant,
okay? You nasty teacher!

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.800
I am only ever honest.

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.520
Excuse me?!

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:20.310
Oof. That's harsh.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.310
They're already so close.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:29.190
Keep studying happily under a
teacher you can trust, my sons.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:36.350
Your Majesty, you have a
request for an audience.

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:40.680
It is long past the time for
audiences. Turn them down.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:43.770
The request is from the royal tutor.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.330
Send him in.

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:51.340
What can I do for you, Royal Tutor?

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:54.320
I thought you might enjoy
a respite from your work.

00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:59.600
A child bringing me wine? That won't do.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:02.320
I am quite tired of that joke of yours.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:08.120
Let me joke, at least, after you told
that awful lie about never having met me.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.070
What else was I to say?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:16.580
I have the Niederglanzreich white wine
you like, but not to curry your favor.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:19.530
Let us drink into the night as we used to.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:22.650
Viktor.

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:28.440
Thank you for pushing Prince Leonhard.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:33.930
Had you not given him an ultimatum,
he may never have been motivated to study.

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:42.430
I only wish for my children to be happy,
and to build a bright future for the kingdom.

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:45.860
Yes, I am well aware.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:50.330
For I am here to grant that wish.

00:21:51.190 --> 00:21:53.360
You have not forgotten our promise, yes?

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:54.880
Hmm?

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:58.950
That if my past ever comes to light...

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:00.330
I remember.

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:04.910
That was your condition for
becoming the royal tutor...

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:41.440
Studying is so hard...

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:44.380
It's important to try.
You can do it, Leonhard.

00:23:44.380 --> 00:23:46.880
Yes! I'll study this... tomorrow.

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:47.690
Badum Badum Badum Badum

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:49.080
Next time, "At Café Mitter Meyer."

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:53.770
Next Time

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:53.770
At Café Mitter Meyer

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:51.860
You can have this sachertorte
once you're done.

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.440
Forget tomorrow, I'll do it right now!
